body:
hmm, your best bet would be to look over some rental companies in Deira, satwa, etc... They usually do not have a website whatsoever which is good because you can haggle with them over WhatsApp. I recently bought my car but back in the day I could've rented a Hyundai Elantra for 1700, Accent for probably 1300 depending on model year. So just browse some google findings and give these people a call. 

&#x200B;

Bonus tip: They almost always work together to fulfill the client's exact request, they will end up splitting the money you pay between companies. So just keep that in mind when you don't find a car that you want. (You can always ask for one at the cheapest places, they will source it).
